+## Optional 3DGS kitchen visual shell
+
+BiGym can composite a finished, visual-only Gaussian kitchen shell behind its
+MuJoCo task geometry. For public reproduction, pass an explicit local profile
+path after acquiring the shell under its source-data terms:
+
+```python
+env = DishwasherLoadPlates(
+    action_mode=JointPositionActionMode(
+        floating_base=True,
+        absolute=True,
+    ),
+    observation_config=ObservationConfig(cameras=cameras),
+    visual_shell_profile="/path/to/visual-shell/profile.json",
+)
+```
+
+The shell adds no MJCF body, geom, collision, or contact. See the
+[visual-shell guide](doc/visual-shell.md) for CUDA dependencies, profile quality
+limits, custom scene alignment, offline installation, and asset licensing.
+The dataset/evaluation utilities under `d/` also expose the backward-compatible
+`bigym-plus-3` camera set and a formal `bigym-plus-4` set that appends a fixed
+`external` stream. Four-camera visual-shell generation is fail-closed and
+requires passing world-lock and capture-coverage reports.
+
+Single-file, prealigned free-view shells use
+`layer_files.combined` with `ground_visual.mode=gaussian_combined`. The asset
+byte count and SHA-256 are verified before the renderer or GPU is initialized;
+legacy walls/ceiling/floor profiles keep precedence when both representations
+are present. Prepare the Infinigen control profile and run its fixed-metric
+room search with:
+
+```bash
+python d/replay_generation/prepare_infinigen_visual_shell_profile.py \
+  --source-profile /path/to/infinigen/scene-shell-profile.json \
+  --ply /path/to/gaussians_shell_freeview.ply \
+  --output-dir /workspace/amd-bigym-3dgs/assets/infinigen-kitchen-freeview-v1
+
+python d/replay_generation/search_visual_shell_appearance.py \
+  --baseline-profile /workspace/amd-bigym-3dgs/assets/infinigen-kitchen-freeview-v1/profile.json \
+  --comparison-profile /path/to/pose-optimized-final/profile.json \
+  --coverage-contract free-view-obb \
+  --search-mode metric-room-placement \
+  --trajectory /path/to/dishwasher-unload-cutlery-long-camera-trajectory.npz \
+  --output-dir /workspace/amd-bigym-3dgs/output/infinigen-freeview-search
+```
+
+This mode fixes scale at 1, fixes the shared floor height, searches only XY and
+yaw, analytically rejects candidates outside the profile's safe/clear OBBs,
+and renders at most 64 of the initial 256 candidates. A passing result is still
+diagnostic and awaiting visual approval. The gated ScanNet++ replacement route
+is documented in [doc/infinigen-scannetpp-route.md](doc/infinigen-scannetpp-route.md);
+it performs no download or terms acceptance before user authorization.
+
